      "width": 1338,
      "height": 418,
      "bytes": 290788,
      "hasAlpha": true,
      "originalBytesPreserved": true,
      "context": "第二种方法是利用多模态嵌入技术，使用从多模态数据中检索到的嵌入作为输入的软提示。"
    },
    {
      "file": "figure-09.png",
      "source": "https://files.mdnice.com/user/3198/281dd863-ab3c-4609-b443-1d8eb5d7b436.png",
